[
  {
    "title": "Metadata, Data Quality & Cleaning",
    "tag": "LESSON 07",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 2 · Digital data and data analysis",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Data Quality<br>&amp; Cleaning</h1><p class=\"zh\">元数据 · 数据质量 · 清洗记录</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Metadata, context and defensible decisions</p>",
    "note": "本课关注分析前的决策：这些值是什么意思，来自哪里，哪些行适合当前问题，改动如何记录。课程使用虚构自愿通勤调查，所有数据为合成教学数据，不代表真实学生或调查发现。不要提前用均值、图表吸引学生删掉不喜欢的记录；统计比较留给 L08。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve the idea of context",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · L01/L02",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.A/C · CRD-2.C/D",
    "html": "<ol><li><span class=\"mono\">00001100</span> represents which nonnegative integer?<br>Do those bits alone tell you whether it means minutes?</li><li>A survey receives “Bus” and later displays a count.<br>Identify an input, processing, and an output.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answers</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. 12. An agreed meaning or context is needed to interpret it as minutes.<br>2. Input: “Bus”. Processing: counting responses. Output: the displayed count.</div></details>",
    "note": "先独立写，再同桌解释为什么算出 12 还不足以知道它的现实含义。第二题同时复习 L02 的输入、处理与输出。这里不要求重复位权全部教学；把“解释需要上下文”接到元数据。"
  },
  {
    "title": "What will make the data usable?",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B/C · DAT-2.D/E",
    "html": "<ol><li>Use metadata to interpret a dataset.</li><li>Combine records using a meaningful shared key.</li><li>Distinguish missing, invalid, repeated and unusual values.</li><li>Apply explained rules and preserve an audit trail.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Deliver a cleaned view + an exclusion log + one limitation.</p>",
    "note": "不把 usable 解释成“整齐”“平均数更合理”。要求学生最终说明每条规则为何适合本次分钟分析，并能从原始数据重现结果。清洗与筛选都是程序可以帮助完成的操作，但分析责任仍在设计规则的人。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Data and data about data",
    "tag": "METADATA",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B.1–5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A response row contains values; metadata explain the identifier, category and unit.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 265\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>A response row contains values; metadata explain the identifier, category and unit.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"38\" width=\"480\" height=\"185\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">PRIMARY DATA: ONE RECORD</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">15</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">ID value</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Bus</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Mode value</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">28</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Time value</text><line x1=\"515\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"640,130 630.3465918192059,135.27368092464624 630.3465918192059,124.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"579\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">described by</text><rect x=\"655\" y=\"15\" width=\"525\" height=\"232\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"917\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">METADATA</text><text x=\"685\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">ID = response identifier</text><text x=\"685\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Mode = main travel category</text><text x=\"685\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Time = one-way minutes</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Metadata make values interpretable and help us find, organize and manage the dataset.</p>",
    "note": "区分一个字段的值与描述字段的规则。例如一行里的 Bus 是主要数据，“mode 是主要出行方式，允许哪些标签”是元数据。元数据也可以被单独研究成另一个数据集；本课先固定当前通勤表的语境。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Changing a label does not convert a value",
    "tag": "UNITS MATTER",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B.2/4",
    "html": "<p>A stored value is <span class=\"mono\">30</span>; its unit is minutes.</p><p>Someone changes only the unit label to “hours”.</p><ol><li>Has the stored number changed?</li><li>What value would represent the same duration in hours?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. No: the primary value is still 30. The new label misdescribes it.<br>2. 0.5 hours. A real conversion changes the numeric value and updates the unit together.</div></details><p class=\"zh\">改元数据不等于转换主要数据。</p>",
    "note": "先复习 CED 对元数据和主要数据的区分：只改描述不会自动变更观测值。改标签虽然不改数字，却可能导致错误解释。30 分钟为 0.5 小时属于可独立手算的单位换算；实验室不会替学生自动推断单位。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Know where the records came from",
    "tag": "PROVENANCE",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B · DAT-2.C.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Provenance follows the synthetic source, raw snapshot, documented transformations and analysis view.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 270\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Provenance follows the synthetic source, raw snapshot, documented transformations and analysis view.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Source</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Synthetic</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">classroom example</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Raw snapshot</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Original records</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">+ field definitions</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Transformations</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Rules applied</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">+ change log</text><rect x=\"935\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Analysis view</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Records used</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">+ source history</text><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"313\" y2=\"87\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"313,87 303.3465918192059,92.27368092464623 303.3465918192059,81.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"580\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"618\" y2=\"87\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"618,87 608.3465918192059,92.27368092464623 608.3465918192059,81.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"885\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"923\" y2=\"87\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"923,87 913.3465918192059,92.27368092464623 913.3465918192059,81.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"125\" y=\"190\" width=\"950\" height=\"60\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4edda\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Collection context: voluntary · one school · one morning</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Keep the collection context and the transformation history with every data version.</p>",
    "note": "解释 provenance 为来源与处理来历，不需要记专业数据库术语。把合成数据的性质直接讲给学生。单校单晨自愿样本的限制将在 L08 展开；本课先指出标签统一不可能自动把它变成所有学校的代表性样本。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Combine by a key, not by row position",
    "tag": "COMBINING SOURCES",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.A.4 · DAT-2.C.2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two tables show IDs in different orders. Their matching connectors are deliberately left unconnected for the learner.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 220\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Two tables show IDs in different orders. Their matching connectors are deliberately left unconnected for the learner.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"15\" width=\"440\" height=\"190\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"740\" y=\"15\" width=\"440\" height=\"190\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">TABLE A · MINUTES</text><text x=\"960\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">TABLE B · DISTANCE (km)</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"760\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"1160\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">02</text><text x=\"325\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">25</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">03</text><text x=\"325\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"820\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">03</text><text x=\"1045\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">0.8</text><text x=\"820\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">02</text><text x=\"1045\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4.0</text><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"106\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"162\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"720\" cy=\"106\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"720\" cy=\"162\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">Match the</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">shared IDs</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Match each time to its distance. Row position is not the key.</p><details><summary>Show matched records</summary><div class=\"answer\"><figure class=\"visual\" style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Correct matched records: ID 02 has 25 minutes and 4.0 kilometres; ID 03 has 12 minutes and 0.8 kilometres.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 95\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Correct matched records: ID 02 has 25 minutes and 4.0 kilometres; ID 03 has 12 minutes and 0.8 kilometres.</title><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"580\" height=\"83\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"615\" y=\"5\" width=\"580\" height=\"83\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">02 → 25 min → 4.0 km</text><text x=\"905\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">03 → 12 min → 0.8 km</text></svg></figure></div></details>",
    "note": "这两张小表是主数据集字段拆分后的教学例子，不是新调查证据。逐行拼接会把 25 与 0.8 错配。让学生用纸线连接相同 ID。这里的 key 是共享标识符；不要求 SQL 或数据库键理论。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A matching label is not enough",
    "tag": "CHECK BEFORE COMBINING",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B/C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Combining sources requires compatible identifier meanings, unique matches and compatible field definitions, units and time periods.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 260\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Combining sources requires compatible identifier meanings, unique matches and compatible field definitions, units and time periods.</title><rect x=\"20\" y=\"15\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">KEY MEANING</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Same response</text><text x=\"142.5\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">ID system?</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"15\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">UNIQUE MATCH</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">One intended</text><text x=\"447.5\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">match per record?</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"15\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">METADATA</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Definitions, units</text><text x=\"752.5\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">and period agree?</text><rect x=\"935\" y=\"15\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">COMBINE</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Only established</text><text x=\"1057.5\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">matches</text><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"313\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"313,86 303.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 303.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"580\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"618\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"618,86 608.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 608.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><line x1=\"885\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"923\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"923,86 913.3465918192059,91.27368092464623 913.3465918192059,80.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"186\" width=\"980\" height=\"61\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4edda\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Unmatched or conflicting? Preserve the evidence and investigate.</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">“03” in two unrelated surveys need not identify the same response.</p>",
    "note": "学生可能认为“有同名列就能拼接”。强调标识符需要共享的发放规则，不能把两个学校都出现的 03 当同一人。重复 key 可能导致一个记录匹配多个值；先调查，不随意选有利的一条。单位不同时必须明确换算而不是改表头。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Inspect the raw table first",
    "tag": "DATASET ORIENTATION",
    "time": "28–31 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.1/2",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">16 raw rows. Is every row ready for a time analysis?</p><p>Look at IDs <span class=\"mono\">09, 10, 03, 14, 15</span>.</p><ol><li>Read the field definitions.</li><li>Find a missing value, an invalid value and an exact repeat.</li><li>Separate a label problem from a questionable measurement.</li></ol><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_2_Data_Lab.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the Data Lab → Data tab</a> · <a href=\"data/chapter2-commute.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read the source dataset and rules</a></p>",
    "note": "先只看 raw，不应用规则。16 是行数，不是 16 个不同 ID；ID 03 重复出现。提醒 id 是字符串，应保留前导零。学生可在纸上圈注问题并提出问题，暂不删除任何原始记录。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Describe the problem precisely",
    "tag": "QUALITY CHECK",
    "time": "31–35 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.2–4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four different problems: missing time, invalid negative time, identical repeated record and inconsistent formatting of a Bus label.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 265\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Four different problems: missing time, invalid negative time, identical repeated record and inconsistent formatting of a Bus label.</title><rect x=\"15\" y=\"12\" width=\"255\" height=\"235\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"12\" width=\"255\" height=\"235\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"625\" y=\"12\" width=\"255\" height=\"235\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"930\" y=\"12\" width=\"255\" height=\"235\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">ID 09</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"74\" width=\"145\" height=\"63\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 6\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"37\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">?</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">MISSING</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">No reported value</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">ID 10</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">−5 min</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">INVALID</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Negative elapsed time</text><text x=\"752\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">ID 03</text><rect x=\"690\" y=\"64\" width=\"134\" height=\"57\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"674\" y=\"87\" width=\"134\" height=\"57\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"741\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12 min</text><text x=\"752\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">REPEATED</text><text x=\"752\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Identical record</text><text x=\"1057\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">ID 15</text><text x=\"1057\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">“ bus ”</text><line x1=\"984\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"1005\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"1110\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"1131\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"1057\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">INCONSISTENT</text><text x=\"1057\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">Equivalent label</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Use the field definition to name the issue before choosing an action.</p>",
    "note": "先让学生用原始观察描述问题，再对照图中的类别核对。数据质量并不只有“数值太大”一种问题。−5 无效的理由来自“经过的单程分钟数”这个语义；在温度等其他字段，负数未必无效。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Normalize equivalent labels",
    "tag": "CLEANING WITHOUT CHANGING MEANING",
    "time": "35–39 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.3/4",
    "html": "<p class=\"equation\"><span class=\"mono\">“ bus ”</span> → <span class=\"mono\">“Bus”</span></p><p>Remove extra spaces; use the agreed capitalization.</p><ol><li>Does this create a new travel mode?</li><li>Should “Bike” also become “Bus” to simplify the table?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. No. The label still means Bus.<br>2. No. Bike and Bus have different meanings. Combining them would lose a meaningful distinction.</div></details><p class=\"zh\">统一等价表达，不能为了整齐改写事实。</p>",
    "note": "这一步最直接对应 DAT-2.C.4。让学生判断 BUS、Bus、前后空格等可按明确映射统一，而 Bicycle 是否等价需要字段定义支持，不能单靠拼写相似猜测。此数据集仅需把 id15 的“ bus ”标准化为 Bus。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Missing does not mean zero",
    "tag": "INCOMPLETE DATA",
    "time": "39–43 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.2",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">ID 09 has no reported travel time.</p><div class=\"options\"><p><strong>A.</strong> Replace the blank with 0.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> Preserve the blank in raw data; exclude this row from the current time analysis and log why.</p></div><details><summary>Choose and justify</summary><div class=\"answer\">B follows the stated rule. A would invent a zero-minute measurement. Missing means unknown, not “no travel time”.</div></details><p class=\"small\">The raw response remains available for review or another suitable question.</p>",
    "note": "区分保留原始行与从当前分析视图排除。这里不教插补算法，不让学生用均值或相邻值填空。其他研究可以依据事先说明的方法处理缺失，但本数据集明确采用排除并记录。只有 mode 的计数问题可能有不同纳入规则，提醒清洗决定依赖分析目的。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A plausible correction still needs evidence",
    "tag": "INVALID DATA",
    "time": "43–47 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.2 · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<p>ID 10 reports <span class=\"mono\">−5</span> minutes of elapsed travel.</p><ol><li>Why is it invalid for this field?</li><li>Can we assume the intended value was +5?</li><li>What does the stated rule require?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Elapsed travel time cannot be negative. The intended value is unknown; changing it to +5 would be a guess. Preserve the raw row, exclude it from this analysis, and record the reason.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生给出字段层面的检查，而不是笼统“负数不允许”。类比 L04 的有效输入范围：检查规则来自需求。不要把取绝对值当成通用清洗。若真实调查能回访，可寻求更正并记录来源；本虚构案例没有额外证据。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An identical repeat or a conflict?",
    "tag": "DUPLICATE RECORDS",
    "time": "47–51 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.2 · Combining sources",
    "html": "<p>Our two rows for ID 03 both report Walk, 12 minutes, 0.8 km.</p><p class=\"callout\">Keep the first copy; exclude the later identical copy and log it.</p><p>Suppose a second row instead said 30 minutes.</p><details><summary>Would the same automatic rule be enough?</summary><div class=\"answer\">No. Conflicting values need investigation. Check the source and collection rules, then document a decision or flag the conflict. Do not silently choose the preferred value.</div></details><p class=\"zh\">相同 ID 但内容冲突时，先核查。</p>",
    "note": "主数据集第二个 id03 是所有字段均相同的重复行，所以按既定规则保留第一条。30 分钟是反事实讨论，不要把它改写进共享数据。真实场景中相同人的不同日期通勤未必重复，必须先定义“一行代表什么”。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Unusual does not automatically mean wrong",
    "tag": "FLAG AND CHECK",
    "time": "51–55 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C · Data quality judgment",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">ID 14 reports 120 minutes and 5 km.</p><ol><li>Is 120 impossible under the field definition?</li><li>What evidence would justify correcting or excluding it?</li></ol><details><summary>Default decision</summary><div class=\"answer\">Keep 120 and flag it as unusual. A delay or unusual journey is possible. A verified entry mistake or a stated eligibility rule could justify a later change; surprise alone is not enough.</div></details><p class=\"small\">L08 will compare an optional “without 120” view as a sensitivity check.</p>",
    "note": "严禁为让图形、均值好看而自动删掉 120。120 对该字段并无预设上限冲突，距离与时间组合值得核查但不能证明错误。实验室去掉 120 的开关仅供下一课敏感性探索，不属于默认清洗；默认应保留 id14。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Write rules before seeing the answer",
    "tag": "REPRODUCIBLE CLEANING",
    "time": "55–59 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C/D · CRD-2.G",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Preserve the raw snapshot while a working copy passes through declared rules; keep an analysis view and a linked log.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 285\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>Preserve the raw snapshot while a working copy passes through declared rules; keep an analysis view and a linked log.</title><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"240\" height=\"140\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">RAW SNAPSHOT</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Original records</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">kept unchanged</text><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"345,94 335.3465918192059,99.27368092464623 335.3465918192059,88.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"307\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">copy</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"8\" width=\"490\" height=\"168\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"605\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">DECLARED RULES</text><text x=\"605\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Normalize equivalent labels</text><text x=\"605\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Keep one identical copy</text><text x=\"605\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Exclude missing / negative times</text><line x1=\"860\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"933\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"933,94 923.3465918192059,99.27368092464623 923.3465918192059,88.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"945\" y=\"25\" width=\"240\" height=\"140\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1065\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">ANALYSIS VIEW</text><text x=\"1065\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Eligible records</text><text x=\"1065\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\">+ unusual flag</text><line x1=\"605\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"605\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"605,205 599.7263190753538,195.3465918192059 610.2736809246462,195.3465918192059\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><rect x=\"155\" y=\"213\" width=\"890\" height=\"57\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f4edda\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"251\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#193148\">LOG: response ID · original issue · action · reason</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Retain 120 and flag it. The working view and log should be reproducible from the raw data.</p>",
    "note": "要求同桌检查规则是否改变了量的含义，是否能由另一人重复执行。标准化是保留语义的清洗；删除分析视图中的行属于有明确理由的筛选，应和“改写原始观测”区分。仅剩 13 行并不能证明规则正确，还需要核对具体被排除的行。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict the clean view",
    "tag": "LAB · BEFORE APPLYING RULES",
    "time": "59–65 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C · DAT-2.D.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">In the <a href=\"Chapter_2_Data_Lab.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Data Lab → Data tab</a>, inspect the 16 raw rows.</p><ol><li>Write the IDs of the rows to exclude, with reasons.</li><li>Identify the label to normalize.</li><li>Predict the number of retained rows.</li><li>Explain what should happen to ID 14.</li></ol><p class=\"small\">Keep the optional “exclude 120” exploration off.<br>Each student writes a prediction before applying the rules.</p>",
    "note": "六分钟任务：前两分钟独立写，接着同伴核对，最后确认能指出每条原始行。ID 03 重复要注明“后出现的同样副本”，不能把两条都删掉。不要先让计数器显示答案再补写预测。学生不会编码也可利用现成工具实行透明规则，本课不要求写列表清洗程序。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check the rows, not just the count",
    "tag": "LAB · AFTER APPLYING RULES",
    "time": "65–71 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.D.1/4/6 · DAT-2.E.1/2",
    "html": "<p>Apply the stated cleaning rules. Compare with your prediction.</p><table><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected evidence</th></tr><tr><td>Rows</td><td>16 raw → 13 retained</td></tr><tr><td>Excluded</td><td>09: missing; 10: negative; later 03: identical repeat</td></tr><tr><td>Normalized</td><td>ID 15: “ bus ” → Bus</td></tr><tr><td>Retained and flagged</td><td>ID 14: 120 minutes</td></tr></table><p class=\"small\">Save a brief explanation of any prediction you changed.</p>",
    "note": "让一人读日志，另一人核对原始表和输出表。16−1−1−1=13；标准化模式不减少行数，120 未被排除。若意外得到 12，先检查敏感性开关；若得到 14，找漏掉的问题。清洗规则对错误数据也可能被错误实现，要用实际行验证。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Collect what the question needs",
    "tag": "PRIVACY AND PURPOSE",
    "time": "71–76 min",
    "code": "Data collection · Responsible practice",
    "html": "<p>The question is: “How do reported commute times vary by travel mode?”</p><ol><li>Do we need names, birth dates or exact home addresses?</li><li>What could linking a location or timestamp to an ID reveal?</li><li>Suggest a smaller, useful collection plan.</li></ol><details><summary>One defensible plan</summary><div class=\"answer\">Collect the needed mode and time fields, explain the purpose, and use a response ID only as needed. Avoid unnecessary identifying details. An ID alone does not guarantee anonymity when datasets are linked.</div></details>",
    "note": "本表完全合成，所以无需学生提交自己的真实地址或通勤信息。隐私讨论使用假设场景，不开展真人调查。距离字段可服务下一课另一个明确问题；若当前只比较方式与时间，不应为了“以后也许有用”无限扩收。这里是负责任实践延伸，不宣称已覆盖整个 IOC 隐私单元。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Cleaning cannot repair every limitation",
    "tag": "SOURCE BIAS",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A concept sketch shows that only some perspectives volunteer and that cleaning acts on those submitted responses.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 205\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><title>A concept sketch shows that only some perspectives volunteer and that cleaning acts on those submitted responses.</title><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"330\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">School community</text><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"79\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 71 108 Q 87 82 103 108\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"79\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 129 108 Q 145 82 161 108\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"203\" cy=\"79\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 187 108 Q 203 82 219 108\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"261\" cy=\"79\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 245 108 Q 261 82 277 108\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"136\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 71 165 Q 87 139 103 165\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"136\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 129 165 Q 145 139 161 165\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"203\" cy=\"136\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 187 165 Q 203 139 219 165\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"261\" cy=\"136\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 245 165 Q 261 139 277 165\" fill=\"#28766f\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"419\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"419,105 409.3465918192059,110.27368092464623 409.3465918192059,99.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"385\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">opt in</text><rect x=\"430\" y=\"10\" width=\"330\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"595\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">Volunteers</text><circle cx=\"532\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 516 123 Q 532 97 548 123\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"590\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 574 123 Q 590 97 606 123\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"648\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 632 123 Q 648 97 664 123\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"770\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"839\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"839,105 829.3465918192059,110.27368092464623 829.3465918192059,99.72631907535377\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"806\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">clean</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"10\" width=\"330\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#cdd6dd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1015\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Cleaned responses</text><circle cx=\"952\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 936 123 Q 952 97 968 123\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"1010\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 994 123 Q 1010 97 1026 123\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"1068\" cy=\"94\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M 1052 123 Q 1068 97 1084 123\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg><figcaption>Concept sketch: the symbols show perspectives, not survey counts.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"options\"><p><strong>A.</strong> Clean labels mean every student is represented.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> Collection limits still need to be stated.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">B. Consistent labels and valid values do not guarantee a representative sample. Adding more responses from the same biased source may leave the bias in place.</div></details>",
    "note": "用两个问题区别 quality 与 representativeness：值是否可用，来源是否适合推论。不要说样本小必然错误；要说自愿参与和单次来源可能造成选择偏差，增加同源数据不能自动消除。深入抽样解释和图表结论安排 L08。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Which TWO decisions preserve the evidence?",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL AP-STYLE PRACTICE",
    "time": "80–84 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.B/C",
    "html": "<div class=\"options\"><p><strong>A.</strong> Replace a missing time with 0 without evidence.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> Keep raw data and record each exclusion.</p><p><strong>C.</strong> Remove 120 only because it looks high.</p><p><strong>D.</strong> Standardize “ bus ” to Bus using the field definition.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer and explain the others</summary><div class=\"answer\">B and D. A invents a measurement. C treats an unusual value as a proven error. B preserves the source and decisions; D preserves the label’s meaning.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Select exactly TWO. This is original classroom practice.</p>",
    "note": "不要只看选项字母：要求一组解释 A，另一组解释 C 的错误假设。指出 B 的作用是可追溯，不保证所有原始数据都正确。D 只因字段定义确认等价才合理；不能随意合并不同类别。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Write a defensible cleaning statement",
    "tag": "REPORTING DECISIONS",
    "time": "84–87 min",
    "code": "DAT-2.C/E · CRD-2.G",
    "html": "<p>Complete the three-part explanation:</p><ol><li>“We began with ___ raw rows and retained ___.”</li><li>“We excluded ___, standardized ___, and retained ___ because ___.”</li><li>“This does not establish ___ about all students.”</li></ol><details><summary>Model summary</summary><div class=\"answer\">16 → 13. Exclude 09, 10 and the later identical 03; normalize ID 15 to Bus; retain 120 because no error is established. The voluntary sample does not establish a school-wide or universal pattern.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Homework: 12 original questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes.</p>",
    "note": "让学生使用自己的句子，保留原因而不是抄写编号串。当前只有课堂模拟数据，不能声称真的发现学校现象。学生报告中还需写数据来源为 synthetic。不要在这页引出均值谁最高，避免超过本课范围。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: meaning, rules and evidence",
    "tag": "EXIT TICKET",
    "time": "87–90 min",
    "code": "Metadata + quality decisions",
    "html": "<ol><li>Is “travel time is measured in minutes” data or metadata about this table?</li><li>Why must a missing time not silently become 0?</li><li>Should 120 be removed by the default rules?</li><li>How many rows remain, and what proves the count is justified?</li></ol><details><summary>Teacher check</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Metadata. 2. Unknown is not a measured zero.<br>3. No; retain and flag it. 4. 13; check the three excluded rows and reasons in the log against the raw data.</div></details>",
    "note": "每项一分，第四项要求 13 和核对日志/原始记录的理由，单写 13 不足。建议 3/4 且不能把缺失当零者进入 L08；若第 2 或 3 项错，先做两例对比练习。下一课将使用同一 13 行视图进行分析，再单独展示敏感性视图。"
  }
]
